  "answer_text": "It looks like there are several different entities associated with the name **\"Chase Capital Services\"** or similar names. Here's an overview of the most notable ones:\n\n---\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfe6 JPMorgan Chase \u2013 Commercial & Capital Services\nChase (JPMorgan Chase) offers a wide range of financial services including credit cards, mortgages, commercial banking, auto loans, investing, and retirement planning.\n\nOn the commercial/capital side, J.P. Morgan provides tailored credit, financing, treasury, and payment solutions for businesses of all sizes and commercial real estate, with dedicated experts delivering industry-specific guidance, empowering clients to manage cash flow, seize growth opportunities, and achieve strategic goals.\n\nThey help clients achieve long-term strategic goals through financing, liquidity, payments, risk management, and investment banking solutions, including M&A, capital raising, and risk management for corporations, institutions, and governments.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \ud83c\udfe0 Chase Capital Holdings, LLC (Atlanta-based)\nChase Capital Holdings, LLC is a trusted partner in investment real estate financing \u2014 a family-owned and operated boutique lending business based in Atlanta with 20+ years of expertise, catering to experienced real estate investors throughout the Southeastern United States, offering quick and straightforward funding solutions for residential real estate investments.\n\n---\n\n### 3. \ud83c\udf3f Chase Capital (Canada)\nChase Capital (Canada) is a private capital platform dedicated to investing in, advising, and helping unique businesses grow into dynamic platforms across Canada and other regions globally, bringing valuable capital and trusted industry expertise to acquisitions and partnerships with existing owners and operators, and executing nimble and creative transactions to maximize benefits for all stakeholders.\n\nThey drive success in key growth sectors such as energy transition, waste & resource recovery infrastructure, and food & agricultural production, focusing on sustainable and innovative projects.\n\n---\n\n### 4. \ud83d\udcc9 Chase Capital Partners (Defunct)\nChase Capital Partners was a firm whose broad platform positioned them to deliver extensive product capabilities \u2014 including lending, treasury services, investment banking, and asset management \u2014 to meet clients' U.S. and international financial needs. However, Chase Capital Partners is permanently closed.\n\n---\n\nCould you clarify which **Chase Capital Services** you are referring to? For example:\n- Are you asking about **JPMorgan Chase's** capital/commercial services?\n- The **Atlanta-based** real estate lending firm?\n- The **Canadian** private capital platform?\n\nThis will help me give you more specific and detailed information!",
